{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/936225-platonic-form-and-eidolon-not-lasting-anymore","id":936225,"title":"Platonic Form and Eidolon Not Lasting Anymore?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-23T13:54:01-07:00","id":936225,"title":"Platonic Form and Eidolon Not Lasting Anymore?","content":"Is it intended that, in the errata, Platonic Form and Eidolon are no longer able to be made Lasting? Or is this an oversight in the summary document?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11888-custos-tenebrarum","name":"Custos Tenebrarum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-23T16:10:39-07:00","id":936289,"title":"","content":"It's probably intended, it never made a whole lot of sense anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-23T16:33:35-07:00","id":936297,"title":"","content":"I always thought it was strange that Eidolon could be made lasting, so it makes sense that they would remove that. However, it seems kind of odd that turning Mana into Tass can't be made lasting anymore because its something Mana does naturally under certain circumstances.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11888-custos-tenebrarum","name":"Custos Tenebrarum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-23T16:36:30-07:00","id":936299,"title":"","content":"It kills ability to disrupt the Mana Economics by having access to Mana Engines. This way you need to dedicate a spell slot to controlling them, put duration high, and/or relinquish them before flooding the market with unlimited mana. Before? You just needed to make it lasting and start spamming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-23T16:43:35-07:00","id":936302,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Custos Tenebrarum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/936225-platonic-form-and-eidolon-not-lasting-anymore?p=936297#post936297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I always thought it was strange that Eidolon could be made lasting, so it makes sense that they would remove that. However, it seems kind of odd that turning Mana into Tass can't be made lasting anymore because its something Mana does naturally under certain circumstances.</div> </div> </div> </div>The process of making mana into Tass from a Hallow involves things in the area of the Hallow soaking in the mana. I'd be perfectly fine with a spell that emulates that process for making Tass being Lasting. That involves using available things in your environment though, which isn't how Platonic Form works at all. The spell in question would be Channel Mana, it'd be weird if the mana when moved from one receptacle to another didn't stay where you put it when the spell lapsed. That'd be like moving water from one cup to another via Matter and then the water jumps back to the original cup after your spell's duration ends.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2632,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","user":"Mrmdubois","date":". 07-23-2016, 07:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-23T16:50:37-07:00","id":936308,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/936225-platonic-form-and-eidolon-not-lasting-anymore?p=936299#post936299\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It kills ability to disrupt the Mana Economics by having access to Mana Engines. This way you need to dedicate a spell slot to controlling them, put duration high, and/or relinquish them before flooding the market with unlimited mana. Before? You just needed to make it lasting and start spamming.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Right until a Master of Prime finds a far away place and creates a farm of Hallows where no one will notice the ripples (or comes up with a spell to prevent the ripples) and designs them to produce Tass in a form that is easy to automate the collection of such as puddles. And because Create Truth can be made Lasting, he can just keep expanding it forever using a small portion of its Tass to power more Create Truth spells. At some point he will need to hire help, and they might move the whole grow op to a pocket dimension or something, and hire mages as guards, and before you know it there is a whole nameless order devoted to producing obscene amounts of Mana and trading it to other mages for favors and power. They might even branch out and get a few more Mana farms going. There could be Mana cartel wars.<br /> <br /> tl;dr: Creating Lasting Tass is the least of the Mana economy's worries.<br /> <br /> Edit: The simplest solution is simply to remove the ability to make Create Truth Lasting as well.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/936225-platonic-form-and-eidolon-not-lasting-anymore?p=936302#post936302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The process of making mana into Tass from a Hallow involves things in the area of the Hallow soaking in the mana. I'd be perfectly fine with a spell that emulates that process for making Tass being Lasting. That involves using available things in your environment though, which isn't how Platonic Form works at all. The spell in question would be Channel Mana, it'd be weird if the mana when moved from one receptacle to another didn't stay where you put it when the spell lapsed. That'd be like moving water from one cup to another via Matter and then the water jumps back to the original cup after your spell's duration ends.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is an excellent idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11888,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11888-custos-tenebrarum","user":"Custos Tenebrarum","date":". 07-23-2016, 09:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11888-custos-tenebrarum","name":"Custos Tenebrarum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-26T20:47:17-07:00","id":937909,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Custos Tenebrarum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/936225-platonic-form-and-eidolon-not-lasting-anymore?p=936308#post936308\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit: The simplest solution is simply to remove the ability to make Create Truth Lasting as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>Plus, make create Truth <b>obvious magic</b> by default! This way the dissonance can dispel it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4272-sp4rt01","name":"Sp4rt01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T01:11:01-07:00","id":937990,"title":"","content":"The thing is that Hallows *are* capable of existence without the use of magic, whereas mana shaped as if being in a tass without actually being in a tass goes against the rules of reality. That is why Hallows can be made Lasting. Plus it makes for interesting stories. Seer Obrimoi have mana management as one of their most important duties, after all. Creating a ton of Hallows would be... displeasing... to their sensibilities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5973,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5973-prometheus","user":"Prometheus","date":". 07-27-2016, 04:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5973-prometheus","name":"Prometheus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5973_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T01:57:46-07:00","id":937993,"title":"","content":"You both missed the point of why Create Truth was brought up which was to illustrate the fact that Create Truth can break the mana economy as easily or more than Platonic Form or Eidolon.<br /> <br /> Also , normal Hallows aren't dispelled by Dissonance so there's no reason magical ones would be under most circumstances.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T15:38:14-07:00","id":938390,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/936225-platonic-form-and-eidolon-not-lasting-anymore?p=937990#post937990\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The thing is that Hallows *are* capable of existence without the use of magic, whereas mana shaped as if being in a tass without actually being in a tass goes against the rules of reality. That is why Hallows can be made Lasting. Plus it makes for interesting stories. Seer Obrimoi have mana management as one of their most important duties, after all. Creating a ton of Hallows would be... displeasing... to their sensibilities.</div> </div> </div> </div>Whether a thing can exist without spells doesn't seem to be a sufficient condition for whether a spell that makes it can be made Lasting (although it is likely a necessary condition). See Ex Nihilo, Create Ghost, Birth Spirit, Psychic Genesis, Create Life, etc. None of those are stated to be able to be made Lasting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11888-custos-tenebrarum","name":"Custos Tenebrarum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T16:08:45-07:00","id":938416,"title":"","content":"The way they're written it could easily be assumed that the things created are Lasting, the only one(s) that actually says what happens to the entity/object created via Making after Duration runs out is Eidolon and Create Life (Create Ghost is a hedge case, it says the ghost &quot;remains&quot; which could mean it expires after the Duration runs out or it can't remain in the Fallen anymore and goes to the Underworld). Create Life is called out as a potential Act of Hubris because of this but the other things are not. In 1e if you made an entity or object via Making it was called out as going away after the Duration expired and was a potential Wisdom check. This could be chalked up to a need to watch word count or the fact that the arcana were written by different authors, but basically it's not entirely clear. Duration Primary Making spells seem to support your claim that they can't be made Lasting, but some of them are Potency Primary which is a point against it. Personally, I'm going to say these spells are Potency Primary and automatically Lasting and Duration just determines how long the thing created remains under the caster's control without need for further spells and takes up a slot of spell maintenance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T21:40:50-07:00","id":938586,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/936225-platonic-form-and-eidolon-not-lasting-anymore?p=937990#post937990\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The thing is that Hallows *are* capable of existence without the use of magic, whereas mana shaped as if being in a tass without actually being in a tass goes against the rules of reality. That is why Hallows can be made Lasting. Plus it makes for interesting stories. Seer Obrimoi have mana management as one of their most important duties, after all. Creating a ton of Hallows would be... displeasing... to their sensibilities.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't understand what you're saying. When did anyone say that Platonic Form doesn't actually create tass?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/936225-platonic-form-and-eidolon-not-lasting-anymore?p=936299#post936299\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It kills ability to disrupt the Mana Economics by having access to Mana Engines. This way you need to dedicate a spell slot to controlling them, put duration high, and/or relinquish them before flooding the market with unlimited mana. Before? You just needed to make it lasting and start spamming.</div> </div> </div> </div>That can't be the reason. If they cared about that, they'd remove Create Essence + Familiar, which is a much simpler mana engine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/191-strill","name":"Strill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T22:57:35-07:00","id":938620,"title":"","content":"Create Essence + Familiar is basically a &quot;full refill&quot; ability. &quot;Full Refill&quot; abilities differ from what I described, because they allow you to gain full mana, here and now, but don't allow you to bank it for later. Prime thing was that you could grab your favorite engine, and then turn that unlimited instant mana into unlimited stored mana.<br /> As for Hallows spam, I don't care about what masters do too much. They can spam Hallows, they can bring dead back to life en masse. We are not arguing that being dead is a non issue, because local Death Master may spend 2 hours per week ressurecting members of local Consilium :P.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}